# MotME brand

**MotME** stands for **Mystery of the Midnight Express**.

Use that expansion in user-facing copy, titles, and narrator identity. Keep **MotME** as the compact wordmark in the nav.

Do not present the product name as "Midnight Express Detective Agency." Detective-casebook voice (night clerk, dossiers, classified leads) is still the in-world tone.
